do CutsceneManager.disable_player_functionality()
join TowerGuide rightmost
TowerGuide: Uh oh.. Looks like one of these darn Elevators broke down.. Again.
TowerGuide: It's not a big deal - happens now and again. In fact, this can be a great learning opportunity!
TowerGuide: Bring the required materials to elevator and we'll get it patched right up for you! Good luck!
do CutsceneManager.send_camera_to_player()
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutsceneManager.enable_player_functionality()
do GameManager.enable_enemy_movement()